{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A minimalist platformer</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/728807d3e2ebde13b62ff748174dfc9e.poster.avif?t=1771094213\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/728807d3e2ebde13b62ff748174dfc9e.webm?t=1771094213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/728807d3e2ebde13b62ff748174dfc9e.mp4?t=1771094213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A vibrant cubic platform world where moving can either be <i>relaxing and cozy</i> or <i>demanding and fast-paced.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A rich narrative</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/ee941821b382e24faf78eec780dc2a8b.poster.avif?t=1771094213\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/ee941821b382e24faf78eec780dc2a8b.webm?t=1771094213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/ee941821b382e24faf78eec780dc2a8b.mp4?t=1771094213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>An intriguing narrator, called <i>Norman</i>, surprised to see you there but willing to make your journey unique and fascinating.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mystery to unveil</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/4247ed864c1896650d2d2350222b1952.poster.avif?t=1771094213\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/4247ed864c1896650d2d2350222b1952.webm?t=1771094213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/4247ed864c1896650d2d2350222b1952.mp4?t=1771094213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Will you fit in?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2>The story of Cyoube is entirely driven by the voice-over of Norman, complemented with subtitles. It features little to no written texts, only written words depicting ideas there and there.<br><br>Cyoube is fully playable with a gamepad or mouse and keyboard. The difficulty can be adapted as platforms offer various ways to walk through the game, more or less demanding.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2981310?t=1771094213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771094213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771094213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771094213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A minimalist platformer</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/728807d3e2ebde13b62ff748174dfc9e.poster.avif?t=1771094213\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/extras/728807d3e2ebde13b62ff748174dfc9e.webm?t=1771094213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981310/